#: scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 932842463b1fb41eb501c90582b8c33ba8762872ccb1c006f20b70dc97838d74
#. default-sha256: 4bb498eebd45dac507dac3c684431607bca30c31c57897e1ee5a3b254c756693
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Several servants stood off to the side, watching their master attentively as he stomped past "
"them down the corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vários servos deram passagem, observando seu mestre atentamente enquanto ele passava por "
"eles pelo corredor."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
