msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I likely could have prevented it. ⟪k:1⟫The look on his face would have made it obvious "
"something bad was about to happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu provavelmente poderia ter evitado isso. ⟪k:1⟫O olhar em seu rosto deixaria óbvio que algo "
"ruim estava para acontecer."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ae4a808f11bd25c249dbc335d489e8d87cb77e3eba1a6a65dfff2a603ad2042
