#: scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9787c016c896a2339465b6d506b818b12180818b55b99d0ecf8c7bf636fef5cc
#. default-sha256: a4dba077ddb4061cc5e3d179184792365bd405293f65fb7340df4a257cd09e22
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Is there something you so "
"desperately want to keep from me that I must ⟪k:12⟫knock⟪k:13⟫ before entering?! That I should "
"have to let you know in advance that I’m coming?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Existe algo que você quer tão "
"desesperadamente esconder de mim que eu devo ⟪k:12⟫bater⟪k:13⟫ antes de entrar?! Que eu deveria "
"ter que avisar com antecedência que estou chegando?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18dfca816ba88b4d0eb4420a572d1bd28be1840e1ed24c62d05dafc79c427681
