msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wh-⟪k:1⟫What— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Do q-⟪k:1⟫Do que— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do que você—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3680b0da9a6399054c81ef49240a37a547f7a22f28d8b1460a1a8573f5474d41
#. default-sha256: 2bc05324b4a5ed24c00993ce4046ab9f83048b1a773af2bed9bd1cfb114f22a2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well?! ⟪k:1⟫Is there?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You went to talk to ⟪k:5⟫him⟪k:6⟫ behind my back, I’m "
"told!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What’d you tell him?! You moan to him about my behavior?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bem?! ⟪k:1⟫Existe?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Me contaram que você foi falar com ⟪k:5⟫ele⟪k:6⟫ pelas "
"minhas costas!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫O que você disse para ele?! Você se queixou do meu comportamento para "
"ele?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb58c29af893cda4843ceb63a404af38304b8dab4cac03703817af876c73012e
#. default-sha256: 8507db5c89314548bcc9926a7ea90a4e62afb17acf7eeb79622d69d3cde0f714
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ngh, ⟪k:17⟫that hurts!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ngh, ⟪k:17⟫isso dói!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0913d4148f924c258ae2fae08ece0a142f0916a7a6e78d065e721a666ae9aeab
#. default-sha256: 3d005e82aff5c7d7110c00d08116ea1de9ef066a22403d61d90524744da55eed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You told him I’m rough with you?!⟪k:1⟫You cried on his shoulder because I’m not ⟪k:2⟫nice "
"enough⟪k:3⟫?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Him!⟪k:7⟫ Of all people!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você disse a ele que eu sou rude com você?!⟪k:1⟫Você chorou em seu ombro porque eu não sou "
"⟪k:2⟫gentil o suficiente⟪k:3⟫?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ele!⟪k:7⟫ De todas as pessoas!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce63e75d0a90acff84f959e8b1fb7d6962643c7bbe62d5533a0877068008f42c
#. default-sha256: 43242a81186adace2d9a59368679c3b3642275883e53a5c40c8c530a54d6e6db
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫W-⟪k:13⟫Wait, Jacopo!⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫You’re mistaken! Let me—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫E-⟪k:13⟫Espere, Jacopo!⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫Você está enganado! Deixe-me—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7b15794e58efe4b9ee342bb8f79402ed7f3b6792265b1c5b4c63855cea73027
#. default-sha256: b8b70a6ecfc154d3a24f92961f9badcd2d0d3e4c49d9b6daf595d43f5246f491
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silence! Not a word! Not a single godforsaken word!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The only thing that comes out "
"of your mouth is excuses!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Lies and fabrication!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silêncio! Nem uma palavra! Nem uma única porcaria de palavra!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A única coisa que sai "
"da sua boca são desculpas!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mentiras e invenção!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55063194def1b3080dd984b2972c644db91be9054572b75b584bf08ede3c3358
#. default-sha256: 0ef5b5d3ac73594415dcac53bfca9ecf8afb6bb0b160d4291ef52dd5bc496c3c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You put on this sweet, innocent little girl act,⟪k:1⟫but what’s ⟪k:2⟫really⟪k:3⟫ going "
"through your head?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Maybe I should just rip that mask off your face!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você se faz de menina doce e inocente,⟪k:1⟫mas o que está passando ⟪k:2⟫de verdade⟪k:3⟫ pela "
"sua cabeça?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Talvez eu devesse apenas arrancar essa máscara do seu rosto!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
